# Celery Beat's own local scheduler state (shelve/DBM), created wherever
# `celery beat` is actually run. Pure runtime state for one machine, not
# something a repo should carry -- it churns on every Beat run and has no
# meaning on anyone else's machine.
celerybeat-schedule*
